se page with filters for revenue country, incorporation country, industry, and sub-industry\n- Bank/financial IS support with proper hierarchy (interest income, net interest income, provision for credit losses, noninterest income/expense)\n- Geographic revenue bar chart on company summary page\n- SIC code mapping with 400+ 4-digit sub-industry descriptions\n- Tag classifier with builtin overrides and SEC Financial Statement Data Set mapping\n- HTML report formatter with accounting hierarchy, indentation, and BS reconciliation check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-07T20:58:56Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb9e6f1ccb3cfdeced85c4443a1b0fcae8bcebab", "message": "revised readme", "created_at": "2025-03-15T22:16:25Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2892e385124f64df772e1d2f6aee855cd9d48b78", "message": "new working vs", "created_at": "2025-03-15T22:07:13Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a538f3c21baa9e83c1b2dc07278f3d4edd24ca59", "message": "working version", "created_at": "2025-03-15T18:01:00Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "34a403179525f5c5ec034e1c8ffeaa3ff04339ec", "message": "fix parser", "created_at": "2025-03-15T15:00:09Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d518280c85df319ce4b382ddf8a013d87e15b68c", "message": "still fixing parser", "created_at": "2025-03-15T14:41:09Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6860e3439fda9e7fb473e5c3778ab5d8f3768081", "message": "fixing formatting", "created_at": "2025-03-15T14:33:23Z", "repo": "edgar_search_tool", "file_sampled": false